stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> WAIT_REQ_DEASSERT : req_synced == 1'b1 && output_ready == 1'b1
    IDLE --> WAIT_DOWNSTREAM_ACK : req_synced == 1'b1 && !(output_ready == 1'b1)
    WAIT_DOWNSTREAM_ACK --> WAIT_REQ_DEASSERT : output_ready == 1'b1
    WAIT_REQ_DEASSERT --> IDLE : req_synced == 1'b0